- How would you extend to multiple pages or prefetch while preserving correctness?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests NUMA-aware page fault design, race-free synchronization, and latency-conscious IO.

## Key Concepts

- NUMA-aware fault handling
- CAS-based per-page race resolution
- per-page state machine and wait queues
- memory barriers and fairness under contention
- optional read-ahead hints

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo
enum PageState { UNCLAIMED, INFLIGHT, FILLED }
volatile int *page_state = ...;
function fault(page) {
  if (CAS(page_state, UNCLAIMED, INFLIGHT)) {
     io_read(page);
     page_state = FILLED;
     wake_waiters(page);
  } else {
     wait(page);
  }
}
```

